{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>After the death of the one who named them, his father.</b> So that the names would be to him for a name, for a token, and for a merit, for they came into his hand from his father's inheritance — for his father sojourned in Gerar, as it is written: 'וישב בין קדש ובין שור', and 'וישב בגרר' — and it was concerning them that he (Abimelech) cut a covenant."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:05.262266562Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}